NOTICE

This Hermes plugin does not include, bundle or redistribute the `opencode2api`
relay binary.

The relay is the property of its upstream author (6Kmfi6HP/opencode2api,
"All rights reserved by default" as documented in that project). At first start
this plugin downloads the officially published release asset for the pinned
version directly from the upstream GitHub release, verifies its SHA-256 against
the upstream-generated `checksums.txt`, stores it inside the Hermes tree
(`$HERMES_HOME/plugin-data/opencode2api/`) and runs it locally.

Users of this plugin are end users of the upstream project and must respect
its terms of service and any usage restrictions its author publishes.
